        <detaileddescription>
<para>Binds a pqxx parameter list into an already-created Drogon SQL binder.</para>
<para>Binary values are copied into a shared, heap-owned buffer and passed as a RawParameter, so the bytes remain valid for the lifetime of the binder rather than for this stack frame. Text values are copied into a string.</para>
<para>Nulls are bound as SQL NULL; binary-format parameters are bound as a <computeroutput>RawParameter</computeroutput> whose bytes are held in a <computeroutput>shared_ptr</computeroutput>-owned buffer so they stay valid after this call; everything else is bound as a text string. Values are bound in append order. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">binder</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Binder that already holds the statement text. </para>
